      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If it's CSS/source engine like, that's the best answer for me personally.\n(At least with regard to turning, if you follow the calculation tables available on the net, you'll get the results you want, and it'll be easier to feel a sense of unity)\nAlso, there is a problem with mouse turning that can be magnified by a lower frame rate, see my topic on this.\n(There seems to be an algorithm set up for stick turning, stick aiming and mouse turning shouldn't use the same parameters)\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
