  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-17T03:37:06.639Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now, the mouse sensitivity option is a slider. It would be useful if a user could type in an exact value similar to how other games have it. \nBelow is an example of what I mean :)",
